WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.734 --> 00:00:16.033
A long time ago, there lived a young boy whose name was Arthur.

2
00:00:16.034 --> 00:00:21.630
Arthur lived in a small village in England with his uncle, aunt, and cousin Kay.

3
00:00:21.631 --> 00:00:28.656
Arthur had many chores and duties around the house, but in his heart he longed to become a knight.

4
00:00:28.657 --> 00:00:31.995
One day Arthur went to the market with his aunt.

5
00:00:31.996 --> 00:00:36.053
Suddenly a soldier on his horse rode through the middle of the road.

6
00:00:36.054 --> 00:00:38.238
He was shouting something.

7
00:00:38.239 --> 00:00:44.130
"The king is dead! King Uther is dead!" shouted the soldier.

8
00:00:44.131 --> 00:00:49.383
Everyone stopped. Some people began to cry. Others began to pray.

9
00:00:49.384 --> 00:00:54.586
The king of England was dead. Who would be their ruler now?

10
00:00:54.587 --> 00:00:58.795
During this time there lived a magician by the name of Merlin.

11
00:00:58.796 --> 00:01:02.378
Merlin gathered the people together in front of a stone.

12
00:01:02.379 --> 00:01:06.307
The blade of a great sword was stuck inside the stone.

13
00:01:06.308 --> 00:01:18.213
He said, "The man who pulls this sword out of the stone will become the next king of England."

14
00:01:18.214 --> 00:01:22.402
Many men tried and tried but did not succeed.

15
00:01:22.403 --> 00:01:29.564
Only the one whose destiny was to be king would be able to pull the sword out.

16
00:01:29.565 --> 00:01:32.876
"Arthur," said his uncle one evening.

17
00:01:32.877 --> 00:01:36.345
"My son Kay is going to become a great knight.

18
00:01:36.346 --> 00:01:38.972
A great knight needs a great sword.

19
00:01:38.973 --> 00:01:43.548
Tomorrow you will go and find a sword for Kay."

20
00:01:43.549 --> 00:01:46.309
Arthur set out early the next morning.

21
00:01:46.310 --> 00:01:49.658
He did not know where to find a sword for his cousin.

22
00:01:49.659 --> 00:01:54.831
Arthur walked and walked for a long time. Suddenly he stopped.

23
00:01:54.832 --> 00:01:57.152
Arthur could not believe his eyes.

24
00:01:57.153 --> 00:02:01.861
A sword in a stone! Arthur walked closer to the sword.

25
00:02:01.862 --> 00:02:06.713
It was magnificent! His uncle would be very happy.

26
00:02:06.714 --> 00:02:09.885
Arthur did not know he was being watched.

27
00:02:09.886 --> 00:02:12.376
He grabbed the handle and pulled.

28
00:02:12.377 --> 00:02:15.527
The sword slid easily out from the stone.

29
00:02:15.528 --> 00:02:18.949
Suddenly Merlin appeared before Arthur.

30
00:02:18.950 --> 00:02:25.372
"Your Majesty," said Merlin as he got down on his knee and bowed to Arthur.

31
00:02:25.373 --> 00:02:30.035
Arthur was scared. He did not know who the old man was.

32
00:02:30.036 --> 00:02:35.126
"Wh-who are you?" Arthur asked.

33
00:02:35.127 --> 00:02:37.686
Merlin rose and approached Arthur.

34
00:02:37.687 --> 00:02:45.081
"I am Merlin the magician. You are Arthur, king of England."

35
00:02:45.082 --> 00:02:51.378
"How did you know my name? What did you call me?" Arthur was confused.

36
00:02:51.379 --> 00:02:57.042
"You are the king of England, my lord," answered Merlin.

37
00:02:57.043 --> 00:03:01.442
"Only the true king can pull the sword from the stone.

38
00:03:01.443 --> 00:03:05.262
You, Arthur, are actually King Uther's son.

39
00:03:05.263 --> 00:03:10.011
You are the next king of England," Merlin told Arthur.

40
00:03:10.012 --> 00:03:13.680
Gradually people began to gather in front of the stone.

41
00:03:13.681 --> 00:03:19.391
They were surprised to see a young peasant boy holding the grand sword.

42
00:03:19.392 --> 00:03:23.921
Soon the entire village heard that the sword had found its owner.

43
00:03:23.922 --> 00:03:28.456
Arthur's uncle, aunt, and cousin pushed to the front of the crowd.

44
00:03:28.457 --> 00:03:32.915
"What is the meaning of this, Arthur?" his uncle shouted angrily.

45
00:03:32.916 --> 00:03:37.966
"Whose sword do you hold in your hand? Is it not Kay's?"

46
00:03:37.967 --> 00:03:42.598
Arthur tried to explain, but Merlin put his hand up.

47
00:03:42.599 --> 00:03:49.301
"You will not speak in such a manner to your king," Merlin said to Arthur's uncle.

48
00:03:49.302 --> 00:03:51.794
Arthur's uncle blinked his eyes.

49
00:03:51.795 --> 00:03:57.187
"King? Arthur?" Arthur's aunt fainted at the news.

50
00:03:57.188 --> 00:04:06.686
Merlin looked at the crowd. "People of England! Behold your new king!"

51
00:04:06.687 --> 00:04:09.483
The crowd bowed down to Arthur.

52
00:04:09.484 --> 00:04:17.598
Then they shouted together, "Long live the king! Long live the king!"

53
00:04:17.599 --> 00:04:22.504
Arthur became king and ruled England with Merlin at his side.

54
00:04:22.505 --> 00:04:27.351
Arthur was a great king. He fought and won many battles.

55
00:04:27.352 --> 00:04:30.828
King Arthur met and fell in love with Guinevere.

56
00:04:30.829 --> 00:04:34.536
Soon they were married, and she became his queen.

57
00:04:34.537 --> 00:04:38.768
They lived in Arthur's castle, which was called Camelot.

58
00:04:38.769 --> 00:04:44.298
Inside Camelot, Arthur formed a society called the Knights of the Round Table.

59
00:04:44.299 --> 00:04:48.318
Only the bravest and most courageous knights could be members.

60
00:04:48.319 --> 00:04:55.016
The table was round because King Arthur believed everyone was an equal member.

61
00:04:55.017 --> 00:04:58.763
King Arthur became close friends with one of his knights.

62
00:04:58.764 --> 00:05:02.237
He was a young Frenchman named Lancelot.

63
00:05:02.238 --> 00:05:07.484
Lancelot spent a lot of time at Camelot with Arthur and Queen Guinevere.

64
00:05:07.485 --> 00:05:12.314
England became stronger and more prosperous under Arthur's rule.

65
00:05:12.315 --> 00:05:18.397
Finally, during one battle, Arthur's sword broke and his army lost the fight.

66
00:05:18.398 --> 00:05:24.392
Arthur knew he needed to find a stronger and more powerful sword.

67
00:05:24.393 --> 00:05:29.100
"Merlin, where can I find a sword that will win all of England's wars?

68
00:05:29.101 --> 00:05:35.714
A sword so powerful it can conquer all of England's enemies?" Arthur asked.

69
00:05:35.715 --> 00:05:42.269
"There is only one sword that can do this, my lord," Merlin answered.

70
00:05:42.270 --> 00:05:45.657
"Take me to it," Arthur said.

71
00:05:45.658 --> 00:05:50.729
Merlin took Arthur to the entrance of a deep shadowed forest.

72
00:05:50.730 --> 00:05:54.379
"My king," Merlin said to Arthur.

73
00:05:54.380 --> 00:05:59.418
"Once you enter this forest, your life will change forever."

74
00:05:59.419 --> 00:06:00.853
"I am ready, Merlin.

75
00:06:00.854 --> 00:06:08.168
Let us go," King Arthur said as he stepped bravely into the forest.
